{"steam_appid":2184080,"steam_name":"Echo Weaver","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2184080/906941351/01ad5dad665cf409c38635fc039f3a256eae6cd8/1781138402/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781545719","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257355520/257c4d10b2f292c907bfe7eeb87e12e360c5076e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781545719","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/0b9a70495f03f785dd7f38c62e6d84cb05a57eb8/ss_0b9a70495f03f785dd7f38c62e6d84cb05a57eb8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791474380","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/dbe859580768399546e6114c7302fbe8820c7504/ss_dbe859580768399546e6114c7302fbe8820c7504.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791474380","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/13851ded8e0ed9dc7fc0d6df3a80f4e72a773ee7/ss_13851ded8e0ed9dc7fc0d6df3a80f4e72a773ee7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791474380","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/26b0f9a69af11674fe09ec4dcf1ad8937f4b1fbc/ss_26b0f9a69af11674fe09ec4dcf1ad8937f4b1fbc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791474380","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/6f44fbcc06c5427499ba324ec935612e29f7e5f1/ss_6f44fbcc06c5427499ba324ec935612e29f7e5f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791474380"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is Your Resource</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an unraveling time loop in this knowledge-based Metroidvania. As the last Weaver, exploit time-altering anomalies and use what you learn to break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/eb674673f93362466a9aa133e0f3327e.poster.avif?t=1791474380\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/eb674673f93362466a9aa133e0f3327e.webm?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/eb674673f93362466a9aa133e0f3327e.mp4?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore what remains. Uncover the mystery. Perfect the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wield the Enigmatic Power of the Glaive</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound to your very being, an alien glaive grants you strange, reality-bending powers. The infinite time loop is the perfect training ground to master them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/bd0573704e8e89c3d4ca4a389b44d1f7.poster.avif?t=1791474380\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/bd0573704e8e89c3d4ca4a389b44d1f7.webm?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/bd0573704e8e89c3d4ca4a389b44d1f7.mp4?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you decipher its fractured essence?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clever uses of its power to bypass obstacles?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use past-loop revelations to find hidden shortcuts?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a Weaver who harnesses the glaive's power will be able to outsmart a world determined to reset you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unearth the Secrets of Provenance   </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrappy survivors populate the loop, opposing those who wish to drown a better future. To carve your path to freedom, you'll need to understand those trapped alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/3aecd46ccd61b36ba0a24d4514d30a8a.poster.avif?t=1791474380\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/3aecd46ccd61b36ba0a24d4514d30a8a.webm?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/3aecd46ccd61b36ba0a24d4514d30a8a.mp4?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pizza-slinging cat who guides you through the ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cranky leader who protects refugees after The Collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wicked cleric evangelizing doom to any who might listen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can dismantle the conspiracy deep at the heart of this world and free those confined to eternal purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets are Your Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every power you will ever yield is already at your disposal... you just don't know it yet. Each new loop offers up more clues; every reset becomes a another opportunity to optimize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/84e3fbe01c2428c0ff83a92ee5e0b122.poster.avif?t=1791474380\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/84e3fbe01c2428c0ff83a92ee5e0b122.webm?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/84e3fbe01c2428c0ff83a92ee5e0b122.mp4?t=1791474380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the pieces together, unlock your potential, and chart the one perfect loop to deliverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique genre mix perfect for fans of both Outer Wilds and Ori and the Blind Forest, master time itself to shatter the cycle once and for all.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-9300T, AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660, AMD R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Moonlight Kids"],"publishers":["Akupara Games"],"release_date":"Oct 8, 2026"}